OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloud and rain spreading north
OL,6,Fand west across the UK, replacing
OL,7,Fearly clear spells in Scotland and
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland. Some sunshine
OL,9,Fdevelops in the south, but further
OL,10,Fcloud and patchy rain reach eastern
OL,11,Fareas later. Heavy showers in the
OL,12,Fsouthwest.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FCloud and patchy rain in the
OL,15,Feast spreads into central areas, with
OL,16,Fmore persistent rain developing in
OL,17,Fsouthern England later. Elsewhere
OL,18,Fmostly dry with clear spells and local
OL,19,Fgrass frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
