OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Facross much of the UK. Drier in the
OL,7,Fsouthwest with some brighter spells.
OL,8,FWinds strengthening from the west, and
OL,9,Ffeeling chilly.
